Add the `my355` command: named bootstage marks from the boot script, the
core clock handed to the kernel, the RK817 fuel gauge reconciled for it, the
charge LED while charging off, and a copy of the console record the boot
script can save to the card. The Flip has no UART attached, so this is how a
failed boot reports what happened.

